Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,判多米尼克·特若图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.95,0:00:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二十五年有期徒刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are hereby sentenced to serve 25 years to life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收押于隆波克最高警备监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the Lompoc Maximum Security Prison system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不得提前假释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without the possibility of early parole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《速度与激情5》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前据我们的了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what we know so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一起光天化日猖狂越狱案发现场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all the aftermath of a daring, daylight breakout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车内共有二十六名重罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were 26 high-risk inmates being transferred...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车上所有人员都已归案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where everyone on board has been accounted for,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯独多米尼克·特若图不见踪影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except for one, Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下午的事故经过精心策划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police have just released the identity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未导致任何人员伤亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the man they believe to have orchestrated the shocking escape
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方认定劫囚车者身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that amazingly resulted in no fatalities this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是前联邦调查员布莱恩·欧康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is former federal agent, Brian O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚注定被这三个逃犯搅得鸡犬不宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fierce manhunt is underway for three fugitives tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各级警力加入搜捕队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Multiple federal and local agencies have joined forces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搜寻多米尼克·特若图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the search for Dominic Toretto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和其同伙布莱恩·欧康纳及米亚·特若图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his accomplices Brian O'Conner and Mia Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管举国之力都在尽力搜捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But despite every eye in the country looking for them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特若图和欧康纳仍下落不明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where Toretto and O'Conner are now is anyone's guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这里没错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got to be it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是自己人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆来了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次有他消息是什么时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you heard from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几星期前 像是在厄瓜多尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple of weeks ago. Up in Ecuador somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感觉怎么样 - 什么怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How does it feel? - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捕人变成被捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be on the other side of a wanted poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会现身的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小家伙该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for bed little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能带他去吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I bring him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么来里约 文森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why Rio, Vince?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:06:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说在你把洛杉矶搞得一团糟以后吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean after you screwed everything up in LA?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无奈落脚在南美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ended up free-falling through South America, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一路躲躲藏藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hitting every hellhole on the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是为罗莎 还得继续逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would have kept on going if not for Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.53,0:06:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有个活儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a job coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望多姆也能在这 但是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping Dom was going to be here by now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次很简单 没他也能做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this one is clean enough we can do it without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:07:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大买卖 几辆高端车 目标简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good gig. Couple of high-end cars, easy targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个熟人招了些伙计打算干这票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy I know is putting together a team to swipe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是还缺几个人手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just need a few more willing bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那批车路过这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the way the car scene is down here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需快速把它们装卸就能拿大钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can unload them quick and get top dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.31,0:07:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这钱赚的容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's easy money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就我看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And from where I'm sitting,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩都可以捞上一笔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it looks like you both could use the payday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旅游指南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东京{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫斯科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果阿邦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些地方都什么相同点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know what all of these places have in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能引渡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No extradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,借过 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we've found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从后面数第二间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, second-to-the-last freighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,药品管理局标签 这车被查封了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DEA tags. These cars have been seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 谁来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 真高兴你没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I'm so happy you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你们要低调行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I told you to lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弹尽粮绝了 不得不做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been running on fumes. Had to make a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别扯淡了 我们只有两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Quit talking. We only got the two-minute window.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 文森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要那辆GT40{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking the GT40.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士优先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这车更适合我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This car suits me better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会见 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我们都去一个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay... we're all going to the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到那儿再把车弄回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get the car there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划有变 等我电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change of plans. Wait for my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she going? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被劫了 无论如何别让火车停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're being robbed! Whatever happens, don't stop the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:12:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快追那女的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go after the girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门禁卡 快拿门禁卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access card! Get the access card!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 那有个桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bridge! There is a bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行李车厢没人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luggage car is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不得不干一票 啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had to make a call, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么烂活儿 欧康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shitty call, O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烂活儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shitty call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们今天可惹了不少麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two stirred up quite a bit of trouble today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人死了三个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three of my men dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三个药品管理局的人也挂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three DEA agents along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做生意有得有失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is business and sometimes things go astray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只关心车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I care about is the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我在哪 就放你们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where it is, and I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纯属扯淡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This roofing plastic says you're full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道在你们那里是怎么做生意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how you guys do business in your part of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在里约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but here in Rio,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都清楚他们的对手是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it when all parties know what they're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,井水不犯河水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it goes both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你妹妹很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear your sister is very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算她藏到天涯海角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever she hides
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也能找到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Will find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国逃犯在火车抢劫中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American fugitives killed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了三名药管局官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three DEA agents during a train robbery...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方警告市民逃犯带有枪支并极其危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Police warn they are armed and extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何人有嫌犯任何消息 请及时与警方联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone with information should contact law enforcement immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还行 你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是特若图家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like a Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.83,0:20:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文森呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Vince?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新闻里都是我们的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we're all over the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把三个药管局官员的死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're blaming us for the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.39,0:20:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪到我们头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killing of those DEA agents on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又成了头号通缉犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means we just jumped to the top of the wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联邦探子哪儿都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The feds have got to show everyone their agents are off limits
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会派最厉害的人马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're going to send their best guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.43,0:20:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有件事可以肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing we know for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要这车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that they wanted this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.35,0:20:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车里有鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because something is in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们查清楚 就知道对手是谁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we find out what it is, we'll know what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们追捕的是专业车手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men we're after are professional runners.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们喜欢速度 而且敢铤而走险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They like speed and are guaranteed to go down the hardest possible way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有要保证弹药充足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so make sure you got your funderwear on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到后一个不落全部带来回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find them, we take them as a team, and we bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最重要一点 绝不能让他们弄到车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And above all else, we don't ever, ever let them get into cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据事发近10小时了 开始行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crime scene is 10 hours old and counting, men. Let's go hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍布斯警官 我是警察局长 齐诺·阿米达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agente Hobbs! Chief of Police, Jono Alemeida.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你手下的殉职 我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to hear about the loss of your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就两个人值得这么大动干戈吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is all this really necessary to apprehend two men?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这两个人来头不小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you something about these two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.57,0:21:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个是前联邦警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One is a former federal officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了五年卧底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}been in deep cover for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.16,0:21:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我们的行动了如指掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows every way you're going to come for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个是职业罪犯 两次越狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other one is a professional criminal, escaped prison twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大半生都在躲像你我这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spent half his life on the run avoiding folks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有什么可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if there's anything we can do to help the DSS...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两件事 一 我需要个翻译{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two things. One, I need a translator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们公关部有很多...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have plenty in the public relations department.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃莉娜·奈维思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elena Neves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.89,0:21:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是个巡警吗 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A patrol officer? - You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 其他人更有经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why? We have many more experienced people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢她的笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二件是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the second thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:22:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别他妈挡我的道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay the fuck out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真够乱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you been, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说话呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better check that tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好快回答我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you just better answer the goddamn question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 你们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了 文森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were you, Vince?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贫民窟的混混都在打听你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys all over the favelas asking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非要弄清你的下落才让我脱身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't get out of there without leading them straight to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弄完了才来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to wait them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放狗屁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is such horseshit
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次你揽的活儿 我们是为你卖命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was your job, and those were your guys! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 欧康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Enough, O'Conner!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说没做就没做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he said he didn't do it, he didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一边儿待着去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go walk it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意在贵国扩大我公司的业务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I would love to expand my operations into your countries
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.51,0:23:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但老实说 你行事风格太过暴力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, quite frankly, your business methods are too violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.35,0:23:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你讲个故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you a true story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.81,0:23:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五百年前 西葡两国殖民者来到这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five hundred years ago, the Portuguese and the Spanish came here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.19,0:23:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都想把这里收入囊中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}each trying to get the country from their natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西班牙人带着长枪短{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Spaniards arrived, guns blazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.38,0:23:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誓要证明谁是老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}determined to prove who was boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但全被土著人杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The natives killed every single Spaniard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我个人更欣赏葡萄牙人的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I prefer the methods of the Portuguese.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们奉上礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.17,0:23:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,镜子 剪刀 毛毯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mirrors, scissors, trinkets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一些土著人自己没有的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things that the natives couldn't get on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想用这些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to continue receiving them,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.60,0:23:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就得听命于葡萄牙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they had to work for the Portuguese.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:24:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在巴西人都说葡萄牙语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's why all Brazilians speak Portuguese today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想以暴制人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you dominate the people with violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终他们会反抗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they will eventually fight
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.73,0:24:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们没什么输不起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back because they have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.57,0:24:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去贫民区施舍点东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go into the favelas and give them something to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.37,0:24:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电 自来水 学校教室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Electricity, running water, school rooms for their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们尝到了生活的甜头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for that taste of a better life,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就控制了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I own them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.55,0:24:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位干杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.26,0:24:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize for the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.97,0:24:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷耶斯老大 有事跟您报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senior Reyes, may I speak with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.56,0:24:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.75,0:25:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我没看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost wish I didn't see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.25,0:25:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.26,0:25:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时米亚在火车上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mia was on that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.63,0:25:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妹在车上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.97,0:25:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我不会伤害她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know. I wouldn't do anything to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.60,0:25:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己接的生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set up the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为只是偷车而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the job was for the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只想要芯片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All they want is the chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.78,0:25:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事先你怎么不说清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've come clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.49,0:25:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在吵什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 多姆 把芯片给我 我给他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Dom, just let me have the chip. I can take this to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿给雷耶斯 一切都结了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll give it to Reyes and set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.96,0:25:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.29,0:25:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.00,0:25:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.64,0:26:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来不听我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.31,0:26:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时我说他是个条子你不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not when I told you he was a cop,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.88,0:26:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.98,0:26:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从不相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never trust me and
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.15,0:26:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我们现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look where it's gotten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.40,0:26:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我们帮派{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at our family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有家不能回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.71,0:26:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你妹妹过的什么日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister is stuck in this life!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉迪呢 多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Letty, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.83,0:26:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉迪呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Letty?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.31,0:26:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离子切割机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plasma cutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.85,0:26:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔克斯 给我一份附近五十英里以内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wilkes, I want a list of every place within 50 miles
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,运送压缩气罐的地点名单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that distributes compressed gas tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.03,0:26:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把证物袋给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass me that manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.79,0:27:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奈维思警官 怎么才来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer Neves. Been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.12,0:27:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是你点名要我 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You asked for me? - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.13,0:27:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的笑容没那么好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My smile is not that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.05,0:27:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你丈夫是位警官 在贫民区被枪杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your husband was an officer who was gunned down in the favela.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.76,0:27:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,六个月后你振作起来加入了警队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six months later, you upped and joined the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.72,0:27:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能保持干劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.85,0:27:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 在里约你是绝对不会被收买的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, I figure you're the only one in Rio who cannot be bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.89,0:27:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说得对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.60,0:27:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.81,0:27:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜忧参半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good news, bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.06,0:27:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I like my dessert first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.82,0:27:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我按你说的检查了铁路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back-checked the rail line like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现几个他们卸车的痕迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found a couple of spots where they unloaded the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.19,0:27:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一条往西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One set of tracks headed west
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直到主道才消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until it hit the main highway, then disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.49,0:27:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一条往东{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But another set of tracks headed east.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.87,0:27:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轴距一百七十英寸 轮胎印宽半英寸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 107-inch wheelbase, eight-and-a-half-inch tread.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是GT40吗 从货单上失踪的那辆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The GT40 that was missing from the manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留了几公里车印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Followed the trail a couple of miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.67,0:27:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这车很容易留印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty easy in this scrub.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要走动没法不留痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't move without leaving a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.79,0:27:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那该死的痕迹照给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the damn veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.34,0:27:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来车开到硬地 胎印就没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ground rolls into a hardpack and we lost that track, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.97,0:28:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不一定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.97,0:28:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那条路穿过山丘通到贫民区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That road heads up through the hills into the favelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.06,0:28:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几年前被暴雨重开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of years ago, it was washed out by a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.77,0:28:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经过那一公里车胎会粘上泥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all dirt a mile from where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.93,0:28:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往那边走 就能追踪到他们痕迹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they headed that way, we'll pick up their tracks there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.19,0:28:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有备而来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.52,0:28:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干劲十足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.69,0:28:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这就去找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find ourselves a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.14,0:28:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.27,0:28:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这芯片绝对不简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's definitely a custom chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.27,0:28:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看边上这些输入数据的菜单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at all these side menus here for data entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's check this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.03,0:29:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 同一幢大楼 每周一单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. Same building, same order every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.04,0:29:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交易时间表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a delivery schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毒品吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 交易量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's a dealer pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.52,0:29:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 他们用这个货量来算钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, most major players, they weigh their money
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.53,0:29:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不用一点点的数了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they don't have to constantly count it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.49,0:29:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是四十九千克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there, that's 49 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在二十年代值一百万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}49 kilos is a million in twenties.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说每批货值一千万{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying each one of these shipments is worth 10 million dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.18,0:30:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才像话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.48,0:30:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.19,0:30:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一亿钞票的金库吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 100-million plus in cash houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.90,0:30:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是查不到的交易凭证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how he keeps it off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.41,0:30:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷耶斯不是傻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's safe to say that Reyes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.53,0:30:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西不能落入他手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is smart to want this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芯片上就是他的交易网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his whole network right there, just laid out on a chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.62,0:30:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔克斯和富斯科去中路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wilkes, Fusco, up the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.83,0:30:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克 乔托 从北边上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mac, Chato, flank north.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.44,0:31:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.45,0:31:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.58,0:31:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外两个翻墙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other two went over the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:31:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.68,0:32:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.18,0:33:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我抓到特若图了 距4个房区...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got Toretto. Four blocks north of your...
