Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.48,0:48:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方监视器发现情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a hit on the police scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.36,0:48:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黎布朗一处仓库发生武装抢劫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armed robbery at a house in Leblon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.32,0:48:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地址核查得出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Address cross-checks against property
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.82,0:48:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正是雷耶斯公司财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}owned by one of Hernan Reyes' corporations.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.57,0:48:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果是我们追捕的那伙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, if that's our guys
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.82,0:48:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是芯片上的内容引导他们去的那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then whatever was on that chip led them directly to that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.49,0:48:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's them, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.74,0:48:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.16,0:48:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在里约没人傻到去抢雷耶斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because no one else in Rio is stupid enough to rob Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.18,0:48:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.35,0:48:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们侵入了黎布朗的仓库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They invaded the Leblon house.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.39,0:48:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who invaded?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.81,0:49:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火车上的那些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The men from the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.53,0:49:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们拿走多少钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much did they take?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.90,0:49:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一分也没拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't take anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.87,0:49:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把钱烧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They burned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.70,0:49:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们烧了我的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They burned my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.37,0:49:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 还说这还不算完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. And said there's more coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.55,0:49:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.22,0:49:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.10,0:49:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.11,0:49:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清理所有金库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.03,0:49:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要那笔钱在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that money under lock and key...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.70,0:50:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一小时内锁好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...within an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.87,0:50:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.29,0:50:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.90,0:50:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一号出动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number One is on the move, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.70,0:50:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二号上路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.98,0:51:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.00,0:51:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五号盯上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got eyes on Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都说 他会把钱转移到某处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know y'all said they were consolidating the money somewhere, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.37,0:52:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你绝没想到这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}y'all ain't going to believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.96,0:52:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难度增加了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this job just got a lot harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.09,0:52:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他既然能把钱放到警察局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's moving it into a police station
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.01,0:52:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说明他肯定认识高层人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's got some serious brass in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.64,0:52:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来我们要提前收场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like this is going to be a shorter trip than I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.22,0:52:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太对了 这活儿没法干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah, we can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.52,0:52:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没法干 或者说不该干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Can't"'? You mean, "Shouldn't."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.98,0:52:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得没什么影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this doesn't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.15,0:52:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按计划进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we stick to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.57,0:52:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.32,0:52:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这破活已经从不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This just went from Mission: Impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.07,0:52:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成疯子才去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Mission: In-freaking-sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.16,0:52:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便吧伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.50,0:52:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是害怕 就是提醒你们一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't scared, I'm just letting you all know,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.49,0:52:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进去就是疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going in that building is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.96,0:52:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:52:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几点发生的抢劫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time was the robbery?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.42,0:53:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十一点左右{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.80,0:53:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.18,0:53:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enhance it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.81,0:53:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脸被遮住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their faces are covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.31,0:53:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面部识别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run it through FRS.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.53,0:53:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hello, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.03,0:53:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wilkes!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.71,0:53:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把特若图和欧康纳关系网里的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run the photos of known associates of Toretto and O'Conner
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.16,0:53:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和最近两周入关巴西的人进行比对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against customs entries into Brazil in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.12,0:53:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,检查海陆空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check planes, trains, boats,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.32,0:53:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和除了航天飞机的一切运输设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything short of the goddamn space shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.63,0:53:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能换个名字 但是换不了脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can change their names but they can't change their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.80,0:53:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定在计划什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something big is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.30,0:53:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是辆一九七零年的肌肉车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a 1970 Charger.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.80,0:53:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,富斯科 上传这些信息到电脑数据库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fusco! Upload these specs into the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.97,0:53:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与卫星每十五分钟交叉核对一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the computer cross-check it with overhead satellites
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.35,0:53:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,及时更新{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every 15 minutes, the van behind it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.44,0:53:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这些车行驶在里约的街巷里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If these vehicles move in the streets of Rio,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.23,0:53:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能得到消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.07,0:54:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.16,0:54:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.28,0:54:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个满街跑霍布斯探员何方神圣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this Hobbs? This Federal Agent running around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.20,0:54:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some American cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们掌控之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.20,0:54:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我们十六个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed sixteen of our men.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.37,0:54:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盯紧点儿他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handle him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.75,0:54:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要了一个菜鸟巡逻队长做助手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look... He requested a rookie patrol officer as his assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.80,0:54:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.79,0:54:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都在这吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all here?- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.21,0:54:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特若图和欧康纳呢 他们在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Toretto and O'Conner? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.42,0:55:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.46,0:55:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我把人手都派出去找他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have all our officers searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.13,0:55:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.13,0:55:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,悬赏缉拿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a price on their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.72,0:55:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出个高价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让城里每双眼睛都找给我找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to get every pair of eyes in the city searching for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.31,0:55:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警署内部图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beauty of public offices?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.74,0:55:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公共档案室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Public records.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.15,0:55:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们放钱的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where he's keeping the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.47,0:55:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保险箱在证物室里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vault in the evidence room.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.66,0:55:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦大家注意一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um. Uh, yeah. Can I get everyone's attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.45,0:55:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边 耽误会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right here, for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.08,0:55:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在讨论如何闯入警察局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about breaking into a police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.83,0:55:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听说过这些词吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone listening to those words?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.63,0:55:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警察叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody? Popo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.25,0:55:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,条子 雷子 当兵的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five-O. One-time. Pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.92,0:55:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是我们的死对头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People we don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.30,0:55:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警察局的设计 就是让人进去出不来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, police stations are designed to keep people in, not out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.30,0:55:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要秘密行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why it's a stealth mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.01,0:55:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没等人反应过来 我们就完活儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be in and out before they even know we were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.81,0:55:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要了解那里面的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we'll need to get eyes in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.43,0:55:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少要知道这金库有多大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least to find out the make and model of that vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.14,0:56:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这大金库...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the vault and then, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.56,0:56:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.11,0:56:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁适合干这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's supposed to do all this?
