Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.68,1:02:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会被识别出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would know we were in the system.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.76,1:02:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好就是一闪而过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best we can do is peek.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.89,1:02:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得用非常快的车来干这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to need some real fast cars to get through this.
