Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.31,1:03:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还需要高超的驾驶技巧和练习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a hard right and a hairpin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.61,1:03:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须开得敏捷又灵活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to need something agile.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.36,1:03:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个画出一个跑道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys mock up a track.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.19,1:03:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.53,1:03:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们去找几辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go get some cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.41,1:03:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服 真舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.01,1:04:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.01,1:04:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那辆怎么样 引擎声相当完美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that? All motor, no tuning issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.60,1:04:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想要一辆那样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted one of those.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.02,1:04:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恩威达大赛三年的纪录保持者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Held the record on the Avenida three years running.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.02,1:04:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, bro...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.19,1:04:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这真是自找麻烦 特若图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a lot of balls to bring your problems here, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.19,1:04:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还带着个条子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to mention a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.15,1:04:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们可以保持低调{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we can keep that on the low.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.45,1:04:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都说很多人在找你们俩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word on the street is a lot of people are looking for you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.37,1:04:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.70,1:04:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没想过我们会认出你们吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't think we'd recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.79,1:04:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有什么车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're kind of counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.21,1:04:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那辆小跑可能走街串巷吃得开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That little coupe may run the streets around here,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.04,1:04:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是那位大哥还从没看过别的车的尾灯呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that monster has never seen a set of tail lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.80,1:04:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Well, she's about to.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.22,1:04:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多米尼克·特若图 来我这赛车了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Toretto's ride in my garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.43,1:04:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那辆车 是辆不错的战利品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that... will be a nice trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.35,1:05:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 传奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, legend.
