Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.57,1:05:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以车赌车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Car for car?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.69,1:05:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要 就来比比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it, come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.91,1:05:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大伙瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what they got.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.17,1:05:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.04,1:05:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪弄到的 波巴的市场里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get that from? Papa Smurf?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.34,1:05:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧欧康纳 使出你的看家本事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, O'Conner, give it your best shot.
