Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.41,1:05:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探头照到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera caught you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 没错 找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Yeah, it still caught you.
