Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.29,1:06:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,技术绝对一流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was real solid work.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.88,1:06:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是三号探头还是抓到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Camera 3 still caught you, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.42,1:06:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it again.
