Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.48,1:07:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 谁都有过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we had a life before you met us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.61,1:07:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我来搞定电子锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'll get to work on the electronic tumbler
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.03,1:07:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是还有个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's still another problem.
