Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.28,1:07:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有雷耶斯的掌纹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And without Reyes' handprint,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.41,1:07:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡迪尼(世界最著名魔术师)都打不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Houdini himself couldn't open this bitch.
