Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.71,1:07:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果里面的一亿美元是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got $100 million in a safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.54,1:07:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会用别人的掌纹来做密码吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You going to put somebody else's handprint on it?
