Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.18,1:07:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 试试 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, check that. - Shut up!
