Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.68,1:07:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.31,1:07:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.31,1:07:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 小事一桩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Nothing like the easy stuff.
