Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.17,1:11:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍布斯探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent L. Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.38,1:11:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.51,1:11:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.22,1:11:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这人是你在贫民区见过的那个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the guy you saw in the favela?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.85,1:11:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.35,1:11:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍布斯是Dss精英特遣队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs is the leader of the elite task force for the DSS.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.90,1:11:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说 他很厉害吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.11,1:11:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,FBI想抓人的时候就派他出马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the FBI wants to find somebody, that's who they call.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.28,1:11:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他从未失手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he never misses his mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.11,1:11:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是个传奇人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy is Old Testament.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.37,1:11:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁血硬汉是他的一贯作风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood, bullets, wrath of God. That's his style.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.74,1:11:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且此时此刻他正在找我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And right now he's hunting us?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.25,1:11:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 我们得加快进度了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, we got to move up our timeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.04,1:11:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 但是怎么来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but how?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.25,1:11:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事已经很困难了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's already been
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.54,1:11:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他再掺合进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}difficult without Wyatt Earp on our asses.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.30,1:11:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多的喘息空间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything, we need more room to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.38,1:11:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼说的没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roman's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.60,1:11:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出去透透气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think we need to get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.98,1:12:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了 70年代的肌肉车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a hit. '70s Charger.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.15,1:12:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.57,1:12:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向安维尼迪拉卡街区东部行驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eastbound on Avenida Atlantica.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.24,1:12:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快快快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.91,1:12:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在前面一个街区停下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stopped about a block ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.25,1:12:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停车 我们步行过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Park it. We're going on foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.98,1:12:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特若图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.20,1:12:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.12,1:12:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被捕?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.45,1:12:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel like I'm under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.46,1:13:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.58,1:13:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.92,1:13:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你们一分钟 看能不能想明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give it a minute. It'll sink in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.59,1:13:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没杀那些联邦探员 雷耶斯干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't kill those feds. That was Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.14,1:13:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.51,1:13:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听命抓两个混蛋归案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just here to bring in two assholes whose names hit my desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.60,1:13:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来像真英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that sounds like a real hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.85,1:13:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真搞笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.48,1:13:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话出自一个警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a guy who took the oath of a cop,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.95,1:13:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他忘掉先前的誓言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then went against everything it stood for.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.65,1:13:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个硬汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or some wannabe tough guy prick
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.49,1:13:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来用电棍惩治恶徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who beat a man half to death with a socket wrench.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.61,1:13:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还真是条好汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, real tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.82,1:13:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在转身双手放在背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turn around and put your hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.66,1:13:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小子 你以为自己有的选吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mistake is thinking you got a goddamn choice, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.46,1:13:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞错了把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your mistake?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.67,1:13:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还以为自己在美国啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinking you're in America.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.34,1:13:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你离家可远着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a long way from home.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.35,1:14:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是巴西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.08,1:14:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 头儿 改天吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, boss. Another day.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 今天不是时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, H, it's a lot of heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.71,1:14:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期 特若图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you soon, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.38,1:14:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随时奉陪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look forward to it, cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.26,1:15:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.34,1:15:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪器装好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracker's on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.09,1:15:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got them.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.33,1:16:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白 来干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. Why come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.21,1:16:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了一个二十美元的银饰值得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why risk it all for $20 worth of silver?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.63,1:16:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它值得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.68,1:16:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该逃走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should run, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.97,1:16:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍布斯会抓到你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobbs will find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.10,1:16:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一万个理由离开 为什么不呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have every reason to leave. Why stay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.44,1:16:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又是为什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.07,1:17:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫是个好警员...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband was a good police officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.91,1:17:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An honest man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.95,1:17:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们青梅竹马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both grew up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.70,1:17:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两年前 他在街上被谋杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years ago he was murdered in the street
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.04,1:17:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我们家门外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right outside our door.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.29,1:17:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是雷耶斯的地盘 他给大家东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reyes owns this favela now. He gives things to people.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而东西不是白给的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But everything has a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.39,1:17:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人们需要一个新的开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people here need a new start.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.72,1:17:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.11,1:17:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火车上那些人不是你杀的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't kill those men in the train,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.40,1:17:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.24,1:17:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在怎么又相信我了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, why would you believe anything I would tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.59,1:18:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她对你来说真的那么特别吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was she so special to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.10,1:18:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为没有人能够理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought anyone could understand now much.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.90,1:18:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你懂我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.68,1:18:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多 但还不够好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close, but not enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.52,1:18:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 时间太短了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, the window is too small, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.19,1:18:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一能躲过摄像头的办法就是用隐形车了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only way we're going to beat the cameras is with invisible cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.65,1:19:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正好知道这么个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know just where to get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.16,1:19:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 出去兜个风吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take a ride, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.33,1:19:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别伤着自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.02,1:19:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经好久没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while since
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.85,1:19:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,驾驶过警车了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been behind the wheel of one of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.69,1:19:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是第一次坐警车前座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time I've ever been in the front seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.36,1:19:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼 怎么耽搁这么久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rome, what took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.28,1:19:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚打包票你一定会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought for sure you'd be
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.63,1:19:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装个铬纺轮还是什么登场的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}showing up with some chrome spinners or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真搞笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.71,1:19:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赌十万美金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got $100,000 that says
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.99,1:20:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比你们都先到下下个路口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can take you all in the next quarter-mile.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.42,1:20:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的像真有十万块似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, your broke ass has got a hundred grand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.05,1:20:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们这次干成了 我就有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we pull off this job, I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.76,1:20:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下两个红绿灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next two lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.51,1:20:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十万块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.64,1:20:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们这次干砸了 反正也死翘翘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't pull this job off, we're probably dead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.97,1:20:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们赌一百万吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make it a million.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.89,1:20:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赞成 一百万赌四分之一英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that. All right, a million-dollar quarter-mile.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.48,1:20:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.31,1:20:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人生只有一次 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You only live once. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.36,1:20:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 你说呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.07,1:20:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底要聊天呢还是要赛车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talking or we racing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.99,1:20:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次别作弊了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't cheat this time.
