Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.21,1:28:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一队就位 出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First team in position, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.88,1:28:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.44,1:28:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.27,1:28:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会照顾米亚的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got eyes on Mia.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫斯科 巴厘 果阿邦 香港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow, Bali, Goa, Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.12,1:28:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有什么共同点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do they all have in common?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.08,1:28:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能引渡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No extradition.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.25,1:29:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有一小时就可以去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're one hour away from the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.09,1:29:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.67,1:29:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.64,1:29:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚真是大错特错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just made a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.77,1:29:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到追踪芯片是费了我点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took me a while to find that tracking chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.19,1:29:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 找接收器可不用那么久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not as long to flip the receiver.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.65,1:29:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特若图 你完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.49,1:29:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老子奉陪到底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.41,1:31:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 多姆 退后 - 我来搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dom! Stand back. - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.33,1:31:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 住手 - 多姆 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull off! - Dom! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.88,1:31:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.06,1:31:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.34,1:32:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在回来的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.88,1:32:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派警队去机场接我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the marshals meet us at the airport when we land.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.43,1:32:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有埋伏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambush!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.45,1:33:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔克斯 反击 搞定他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wilkes, suppression fire. Shut them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.88,1:33:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,掩护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stagger-step. Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.55,1:33:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch them!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.19,1:33:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut us loose!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.36,1:33:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 放开我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Cut us loose!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.81,1:35:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都上来了吗 - 开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're good? - Yeah, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.47,1:36:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.35,1:36:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没见过我儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to meet my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.81,1:36:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nico.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.32,1:36:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会见到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.70,1:36:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.79,1:36:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们用你的名字给他命名的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we named him after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.21,1:36:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多米尼克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dominic."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.80,1:36:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证 文森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got my word, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.35,1:36:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直是我的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were always my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.07,1:37:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你养儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got eyes on Nico now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.25,1:37:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了 没有多少时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to move. We don't have that much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.75,1:37:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我订了趟航班跑路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got us a flight out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.96,1:37:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五小时后离开里约热内卢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can leave Rio in the rearview in the next five hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.63,1:37:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.84,1:37:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是完成计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.26,1:37:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 你疯了吗 我们办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy, Dom? We can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.26,1:37:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这无疑是在自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a suicide mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.93,1:37:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你兄弟还躺在那里尸骨未寒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your man over there on the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.98,1:37:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划破产了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plan is busted!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.31,1:37:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是胡扯 雷耶斯知道我们要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bullshit, man. Reyes knows we're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.90,1:37:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.57,1:37:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们增派了三倍的人手在警察局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tripled the detail at the police station.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.78,1:37:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这将是一场血战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's going to be a wall of gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.24,1:37:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能轻易饶了雷耶斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reyes doesn't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.62,1:38:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个陷阱 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trap, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.70,1:38:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你早知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.79,1:38:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 听他们的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dom, listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.79,1:38:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁还有机会 逃吧 离开里约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, before it's too late. Leave Rio.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.76,1:38:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.26,1:38:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑不会自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running ain't freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.72,1:38:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.23,1:38:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们自己有权决定去留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you're all free to make your own choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.86,1:38:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我入伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.37,1:38:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特若图 我和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ride with you, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.29,1:38:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最起码杀了那个狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least until we kill that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.26,1:38:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 那计划是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's the plan, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.68,1:39:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想藏也藏不住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just go sneaking around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.22,1:39:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't sneak.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.98,1:39:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他唯一在意的就是他的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing he cares about is his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.36,1:39:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们控制了钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pull that,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.69,1:39:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就控制了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we pull him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.50,1:39:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.71,1:39:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全部警员出动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called in every cop on our payroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.88,1:39:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万无一失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.39,1:39:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个入口都有人守卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got every entrance covered with weapons teams.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.89,1:39:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使上帝也不可能拿走您的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God Himself couldn't get at your money if He wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.14,1:39:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不担心上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God isn't my worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.24,1:39:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.53,1:40:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.88,1:41:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.09,1:41:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来打劫了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're taking the vault!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.64,1:41:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 金库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - The vault!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.86,1:41:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.45,1:41:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.00,1:41:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.21,1:41:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.58,1:42:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米亚 路况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it out, Mia!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.04,1:42:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直走 两个街区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got a straight shot for two blocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.04,1:42:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 右转 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go right.- Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.94,1:42:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不出意料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the plan is working.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.61,1:42:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里约所有的警车都在追你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys have every corrupt cop in Rio on your tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.78,1:42:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得跑快一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to move fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.57,1:42:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最佳落点在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the best route?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.74,1:42:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向前行驶半英里到的卢福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, keep going straight another half-mile onto Rua Fonseca,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.07,1:42:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后左转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then go left.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.75,1:42:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行不通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ain't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.87,1:42:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多姆 前面有钉子 有钉子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spikes ahead, Dom. We got spikes!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.88,1:42:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往右开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going right!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.84,1:43:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 太挤了 过不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's too tight, we're not going to fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.21,1:43:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没选择了 立刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got no choice. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.36,1:43:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗屎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.16,1:43:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真要命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.54,1:43:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 我都听到动静了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I am hearing all this chatter.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.13,1:43:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们把银行拖出来了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just take out a bank?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.46,1:43:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了两辆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two inbound!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.89,1:43:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你们左侧有个巷子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, there's an alley coming up on your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.43,1:43:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.48,1:44:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little bastard!
