Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.97,1:59:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你会去东京{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you wanted to go to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.80,1:59:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会去的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.06,1:59:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.03,2:00:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice surprise.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.45,2:00:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.34,2:00:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我见过的老妹最幸福的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the happiest I've ever seen my sister.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.43,2:00:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because we're free.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.78,2:00:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想再比一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I want another shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.57,2:00:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.66,2:00:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.41,2:00:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有赌注 没有别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wagers, nobody else.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.33,2:00:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就你和我 只此一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just you and me, once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.59,2:01:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定能承受失败的打击吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you can handle the disappointment?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.43,2:01:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.14,2:01:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 欧康纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.31,2:01:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你有多大本领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.69,2:03:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(华盛顿 外交保安局总部)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.00,2:03:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看下这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to look at that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.75,2:03:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柏林 今晨三点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berlin. 3:00 a.m. This morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.96,2:03:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一队车手抢劫了一辆军用运输车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A team of drivers hijacked a military convoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.84,2:03:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 特若图吗 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Toretto? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.68,2:03:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't interested.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.72,2:04:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你会感兴趣 继续看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you are. Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.07,2:04:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信活见鬼了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in ghosts?

